<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended Jan 17, compared with the Jan 10 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.19 vs 5.28</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............5.03 vs 5.03</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.47 vs 5.45</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.34 vs 5.34</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.44 vs 5.42</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.44 vs 5.44</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.81 vs 6.80</p>
</text>
